— BRUSHES: pen, marker, pencil, airbrush and calligraphy. Pick a brush from the row of samples in the canvas panel, and your partner sees it the same way.

— ERASER with its own size and three modes: hard, soft and “Whole line”. The last one removes a touched line completely, and undo puts it back.

— Lines no longer lag behind your finger or cut corners: smoothing is off by default, and you can turn it on in brush settings.

— Layers work properly: the eraser only erases its own layer, and fills show up in the replay and on gallery tiles.

— Watching together: the ad now plays after you leave the room, not before it. On iPhone the room no longer stops responding to touches.

— Launch screen: pick the Halloween “Key” animation in Appearance.

— Halloween theme with a night background and lilac outlines. It is free and stays with everyone who opens the app before November 1.

— Full-screen photos can be saved to your gallery.

— Fixed: the back gesture no longer freezes the app, the timer date no longer resets by itself, chat opens at the latest message, and coloring pages keep their picture.
